WakeUp protocol implementation
Adapted from airline233/WakeUpDecoder
https://github.com/airline233/WakeUpDecoder
Licensed under Apache License 2.0; see decoder-LICENSE.txt.
Modified: translated Python protocol algorithms to Kotlin; added strict input
validation, injectable Android identity and HTTP transport, and response limits.
No official WakeUp APK, private signing key, user token or real device ID is
bundled. Public client protocol constants are documented in WAKEUP_PROTOCOL.md.
This independent project is not affiliated with or endorsed by WakeUp.
